<title>FRANCE: Suez, Lyonnaise announce merger news conf Friday.</title>
<headline>Suez, Lyonnaise announce merger news conf Friday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>French companies Compagnie de Suez and Lyonnaise des Eaux said on Wednesday they would hold a news conference at 1630 GMT on Friday to present their merger plans.</p>
<p>The Suez conglomerate and utilities group Lyonnaise issued a joint statement announcing the news conference.</p>
<p>They have already agreed to merge but have yet to reveal the terms of the operation.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
